#!/bin/sh
unset PYTHONPATH PYTHONHOME
if [ "${0##*/}" = "tuxindrive-doctor" ] || [ "${0##*/}" = "tuxdrive-doctor" ] || [ "${1:-}" = "--system-check" ]; then
  if [ "${1:-}" = "--system-check" ]; then
    shift
  fi
  exec /usr/bin/python3 -I -c 'import runpy,sys; sys.path.insert(0,"/usr/lib"); sys.argv[0]="tuxindrive --system-check"; runpy.run_module("tuxindrive.platform_support",run_name="__main__")' "$@"
fi
rclone_config_root="${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-${HOME}/.config}/rclone"
if [ -f "$rclone_config_root/.tuxindrive-encrypted" ] || [ -f "$rclone_config_root/.tuxdrive-encrypted" ]; then
  export RCLONE_PASSWORD_COMMAND=/usr/lib/tuxindrive/rclone-password
fi
state_base="${XDG_STATE_HOME:-${HOME}/.local/state}"
if [ -d "$state_base/tuxdrive" ] && [ ! -e "$state_base/tuxindrive" ]; then
  state_root="$state_base/tuxdrive"
else
  state_root="$state_base/tuxindrive"
fi
mkdir -p "$state_root"
chmod 700 "$state_root"
printf '\n=== launcher %s ===\n' "$(date --iso-8601=seconds)" >>"$state_root/startup.log"
chmod 600 "$state_root/startup.log"
exec /usr/bin/python3 -I -c 'import runpy,sys; sys.path.insert(0,"/usr/lib"); sys.argv[0]="tuxindrive"; runpy.run_module("tuxindrive.app",run_name="__main__")' tuxindrive "$@" >>"$state_root/startup.log" 2>&1
